<title>PORTUGAL: ATHLETICS-WORLD CROSS CHALLENGE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD CROSS CHALLENGE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUFEIRA, Portugal 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results in</p>
<p>the seventh round of the International Amateur Athletic</p>
<p>Federation World Cross Challenge series on Sunday:</p>
<p>Men (10,000 metres)</p>
<p>1. Tom Nyariki (Kenya) 28 mins 41 secs</p>
<p>2. Barnard Barmasai (Kenya) 29.03</p>
<p>3. Paulo Guerra (Portugal) 29.36</p>
<p>4. Domingos Castro (Portugal) 29.41</p>
<p>5. Richard Kosgei (Kenya) 29.46</p>
<p>6. Andrew Pearson (Britain) 29.47</p>
<p>7. Benedict Ako (Tanzania) 29.47</p>
<p>8. Mathias Ntawulikur (Rwanda) 29.59</p>
<p>9. Joseph Kipruto (Kenya) 30.00</p>
<p>10. Paul Evans (Britain) 30.04</p>
<p>Women (6,000 metres)</p>
<p>1. Elena Fidatov (Romania) 19 mins 31 secs</p>
<p>2. Fernanda Ribeiro (Portugal) 19.33</p>
<p>3. Coleen de Reuck (South Africa) 19.45</p>
<p>4. Anita Weyermann (Switzerland) 19.53</p>
<p>5. Tegla Lorupe (Kenya) 20.22</p>
