<p>9. Ana Dias (Portugal) 20.44</p>
<p>10. Helena Sampaio (Portugal) 20.57</p>
<p>Standings Men:</p>
<p>1. Paulo Guerra (Portugal) 63 points</p>
<p>2. Robert Stefko (Slovakia) 60 points</p>
<p>3. Yann Millon (France) 58 points</p>
<p>4. Andrew Pearson (Britain) 55 points</p>
<p>5. Hendrick Ramaala (South Africa) 54 points</p>
<p>6. Million Wolde (Ethiopia) 53 points</p>
<p>7. Bernard Barmasai (Kenya) 47 points</p>
<p>7. Jon Brown (Britain) 47 points</p>
<p>9. Keith Cullen (Britain) 45 points</p>
<p>10. Paul Tergat (Kenya) 44 points</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>1. Elena Fidatov (Romania) 100 points</p>
