<p>7. Lucia Subano (Kenya) 48 points</p>
<p>9. Getenesh Urge (Ethiopia) 45 points</p>
<p>10. Stefanija Statkuviene (Lithuania) 42 points</p>
<p>Note: Negura is currently suspended from competition pending</p>
<p>a hearing after producing a positive drug test.</p>
